    <h1>Where you are, where you're going, and the bit in between.</h1>
    <p>Executive and career coaching for senior leaders. Return-to-work and confidence coaching for those rebuilding professional momentum. Virtual or in-person Dublin.</p>
    <a href="https://calendly.com/hello-iamphoenix/30min" onclick="Calendly.initPopupWidget({url: 'https://calendly.com/hello-iamphoenix/30min'});return false;" class="btn-primary">Book a free chemistry chat</a>
